  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be nice if users would be able to scale their UI. Since the userbase of VRChat consists out of people with high end FHD, 2K and 4K monitors aswell as people with just 1280x1024 or something simmilar it could look pretty big on big monitors and users may want to scale it down. on the other hand people with smaller screens maybe want it to be bigger. In VR it may also be pretty useful if you could change the UI size since some people have a very unsteady hand and have difficultys hitting buttons in the menu. Also the resolution of the VR headsets may vary. Therefore I would suggest two UI scaling sliders (one for VR and one for desktop).",
